<https://w3id.org/codo#Disorder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A disorder refers to an abnormal condition or disruption in the regular functioning of an organ, system, or overall body. It can involve physical, mental, or physiological dysregulation that affects normal processes and may lead to symptoms or impairments." .
<https://w3id.org/codo#Disorder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In medicine, a disturbance of normal functioning of the mind or body. Disorders may be caused by genetic factors, disease, or trauma" .
